<div class="institution-eligibility-outcome institution-eligibility-outcome--{{type}}">
    {{#isAgreed}}
        <p class="institution-eligibility-outcome__text">Yes, your institution has an agreement with eLife</p>
        <p class="institution-eligibility-outcome__text">{{institution}} has an agreement with eLife until {year} that allows authors affiliated
        with the University or its child organisations (as defined by the Research Organisation Registry) to publish an unlimited number
        of articles without paying article processing charges (APCs).</p>
        <a href="#" class="institution-eligibility-outcome_agreed_link">Check the Research Organisation Registry.</a>
    {{/isAgreed}}
    {{#isNotAgreedPublished}}
        <p class="institution-eligibility-outcome__text">Your institution does <u>not</u> have an agreement with eLife.</p>
        <p class="institution-eligibility-outcome__text">Submissions not covered by a publishing agreement will be charged at our standard publication fee of $3,750,
        payable for all submissions sent for peer review.</p>
        <p class="institution-eligibility-outcome__text">Contact your library or research office to find out about funding options.</p>
    {{/isNotAgreedPublished}}
</div>
